WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.180
That brings us to the end of our session.

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.740
You are now officially prepared to be the difference

00:00:04.740 --> 00:00:06.160
in an emergency.

00:00:06.160 --> 00:00:09.380
Remember the three big takeaways one last time.

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:14.220
One, if someone is unresponsive, call 911 immediately.

00:00:14.220 --> 00:00:18.940
Two, if they are not breathing, start high quality CPR.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.620
Three, if an AED is available,

00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.219
turn it on and follow the voice prompts.

00:00:24.219 --> 00:00:27.020
Now is the time for any final questions,

00:00:27.020 --> 00:00:29.059
comments, or concerns.

00:00:29.059 --> 00:00:32.139
Whether it's about a specific technique we practiced

00:00:32.139 --> 00:00:35.380
or a what if scenario you're still curious about,

00:00:35.380 --> 00:00:37.580
don't hesitate to ask.

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:40.380
Thank you for your focus and your hard work today.

00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:42.060
You are leaving here with the skills

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:44.860
and the confidence to act when it matters most.

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:47.020
That brings us to the end of our session.

00:00:47.020 --> 00:00:48.619
You are now officially prepared

00:00:48.619 --> 00:00:51.000
to be the difference in an emergency.

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:54.220
Remember the three big takeaways one last time.

00:00:54.299 --> 00:00:59.139
One, if someone is unresponsive, call 911 immediately.

00:00:59.139 --> 00:01:00.660
Two, if they are not.

